  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NPM Improvement of Health and Education Services</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objectives are quality care in maternal and children&#x2019;s health, and quality education. All 144 health facilities of the CELPA church are targeted with government-approved training in maternal and children&#x2019;s health. 500 schools are targeted with training in administrative and pedagogical topics. Advocacy for state payment of health and school facilities and staff. Raised awareness of maternal health and importance of education in local communities. The whole of DR Congo is included.</narrative>
  </description>
